SUMMARY:Freshwater Fishing Fundamentals (Online)
DESCRIPTION:Join NCWF Fall Line Outdoors Chapter for a webinar series about fishing! This one-hour introductory webinar is designed to teach adult beginners the fundamentals of freshwater fishing. Participants will learn about common rod and reel setups\, how to select appropriate baits and lures\, and how to apply basic casting techniques. The session will also cover simple rig setups and effective fishing methods for targeting common freshwater species. By the end of the webinar\, participants will have the foundational knowledge and confidence needed to prepare for hands-on fishing events. Join us for a “reely” good time! \n \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/freshwater-fishing-fundamentals-online/
CATEGORIES:Featured
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncwf.org/wp-content/uploads/freshfish.jpg
END:VEVENT
